WEBVTT

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.150
Young lady.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:37.310
It's nice to get out of the city and feel the breeze like this once in a while, isn't it?

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.550
Yes.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:42.790
But the way you suddenly wanted to go see a movie set...  Do you like movies?

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:44.810
Yes.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.920
It's so beautiful!

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.320
It's like it's softly shimmering!

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:05.430
It's a radiant gemstone that sparkles in the night.  Men can become lost in its mysterious glow.

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:09.270
Island ahoy!

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.980
Look over there, young lady.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.640
I'm sure I'll find clues about him on that island.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.160
P-Please stop!

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.140
Where did you get the jewel?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.320
I-It wasn't me!

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.850
I don't know anything.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.200
Where?!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.680
I'm delighted that a client of ours would come all the way to this island to pay us a visit.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.290
Come, shall we head up?

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:12.170
The filming location is by the house you can see up there.  It might be a bit of a walk, I'm afraid.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.940
My, my.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.130
Let's go, Tome-san.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.750
Tome-san?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:28.060
I must apologize for saying something like this, young lady.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.560
I've got an unpleasant feeling.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.080
Like something bad is going to happen.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:38.340
It'll be fine, Tome-san.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:39.190
No.

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.810
Please don't go anywhere alone no matter what.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:46.450
Take me with you wherever you go.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.520
Thank you.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.090
I hate this wind.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.650
It looks like a rough one.

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.840
I wonder if we'll be OK on the boat tomorrow.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:14.430
And we're on such a remote island, too.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:16.700
It's an isolated island way out in the middle of the sea.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:22.040
Apparently they were using this island's remoteness to conduct some top-secret research during the war.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.030
See.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.210
That's leftover from the research facilities.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:29.640
They took all the natives on the island to use in human experimentation.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.120
There's nobody left on the island except some old folks.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.610
Or that's the story I heard, anyway.

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:35.250
Oh.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.760
And that's why they call it "White Hair Island".

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.660
That's creepy.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.640
It's just one of those silly stories.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.040
It's a signal.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.330
Don't say anything.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.250
He's not one of our guys.

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.260
Is something the matter, young lady?

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.810
No.  It's nothing.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.900
Thank heavens.  Ken-niichan is all right.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.170
W-W-We've got trouble!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.520
Trouble!

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.820
Hey, hey.  What's wrong?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.830
It's the producer!  Sakami-san was killed!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.910
And the jewel...

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.160
The jewel is missing!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.510
It has to be him.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:16.470
We passed by him when we were coming back here.

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.940
What'd he look like?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.060
He creeped me out.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:23.570
He was wearing a dirty trenchcoat and had a weird steady look in his eye.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.580
Maybe he just wasn't an easygoing guy.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.550
Don't joke around!  Doesn't that mean that he's still prowling around the island?

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.630
Director!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:35.810
No good.  We can't get a boat here.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:36.860
And the police?

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.540
They're coming first thing in the morning.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.060
I guess we're spending the night with Sakami-san's corpse.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.320
I'm not doing that.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:47.080
I'm going back to my room.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.620
Stay right here.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.550
We're safer if we stick together.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.050
Couldn't the killer be one of us?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:56.080
Weren't you having money problems?

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.810
What did you say?!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.580
Stop it, you two.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.430
A murderer on a remote island.  This is good.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.070
Just one more person left.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.320
Who'll know what happened; she'll be dead.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.830
That light...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.160
Ken-niichan!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.290
I'm so glad, Ken-niichan.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:57.960
You're OK.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.070
Where is that bastard?

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.790
He called you here with that jewel, didn't he?

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.290
Are you talking about Twenty Faces?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.000
Where the hell is he?!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.010
I'm looking for him too...

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:15.500
I waited and waited, but he never showed!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.810
He abandoned me.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.040
That's not true!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.270
Shit!  Why is it all about you?!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:26.240
I lost everything.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.830
My comrades, the boss...

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.270
Everything!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.170
I have...

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.820
...nothing left.

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:51.030
I've been looking for him too.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.100
That's why I came to this island.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:57.430
But then the jewel went missing, and someone was murdered.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.080
But...

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.750
...I was able to see you again.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.950
Ken-niichan!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.330
And that director fellow is so persistent.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:58.400
He told me to come visit him in Tokyo because he wants to put me in a movie!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.350
But...

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.460
Young lady?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.560
Is everything all right?

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.000
You've been like that all day.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.470
No, it's nothing.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:12.340
Oh, Tome-san.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.170
I'll sleep down there tonight.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:20.000
Out of the question.  I always slept on this sort of bed, even at home, so I'm fine with it.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.920
You slept on the floor even at your house?

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:23.780
That's exactly the thing.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:27.890
We have a big family so we slept wherever we could.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.610
I've slept in all sorts of places too.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:35.900
In trains, on the decks of boats, even on park benches.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.400
My, she had it rough after all.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.430
I miss those days.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.280
You know, Tome-san, why don't we sleep together in the bed?

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.690
Eh, I–

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.910
I'll be scolded!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.540
In that case...

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.690
I'll sleep down here!

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.370
Young lady...

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.890
I guess it can't be helped.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.830
Don't you feel cramped?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.860
No.  This is fun.

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:14.400
This is the first time I've shared a futon with someone since I was a little girl.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:18.920
Until I left home, I shared a futon with my older sister every night.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.420
Oh yeah?

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:25.960
I wonder if I would have slept like this if I'd had an older brother or sister.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:35.150
My sister always let me use her arm as a pillow like this.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.860
You sleep really well like this for some mysterious reason.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.420
I'm not too heavy?

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.890
Nope.  Not in the least.

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:46.260
I'll always be by your side.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.110
Yeah.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.710
Sorry, Tome-san.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.230
Even if it's just the tiniest clue, I've got to go after him.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.720
Because I'm the daughter of Twenty Faces.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.360
This was it.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:38.480
Darn it.  The rain washed away the footprints.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.840
Ken-niichan.

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:50.820
The radiant gemstone.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.650
It's hollow.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:13.520
The weeds are only short around here.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:16.580
Is there an entrance somewhere?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.410
This is it.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.500
I've seen a place that looked like this before.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.730
It looks just like Twenty Faces' hideout.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.420
Ken-niichan?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.140
So we finally meet.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:29.430
I've been waiting for you.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.220
That's Twenty Faces' jewel.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.940
There were two of these originally.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.880
He had one and I had one.

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:41.650
Do you know him?

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:47.150
The radiant gemstone seeks out blood.  Another man's blood was shed yesterday.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.560
And now it's come back.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.990
With me.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.080
You mean it was you?!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:04.020
Well now,

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.960
shall I take it back from you now?

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.680
Take back everything you got from him.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.480
You'll never win his heart.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.430
Go on, try and escape.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:48.250
I called you here so you could taste the same feelings as I did.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.470
This?

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.160
This is all she is?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.040
You're nothing but a child.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.750
I'm disappointed in you.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.260
Do you know what this is?  It's a dissection table.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.670
Countless people died on it years ago.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.600
And I was one of them.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.320
And now I'll offer you that same fate.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.140
Chiko.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:01.260
You're rusty.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:03.830
I taught you how to escape and how to fight.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:10.710
Did you pretend to be the boss and summon Chiko here?

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.630
You little fish weren't supposed to have lived.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.090
Come again?

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.350
What's with this bitch?

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.280
You're nothing but a plaything.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.290
Still playing tag?

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.850
No.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.980
Our game of tag is already over.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.980
Chiko...

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.370
You got me.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.940
She has the same eyes as he did.

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.910
Is he still alive?

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:59.700
It looks like I've got all sorts of fun coming my way.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.750
A doll?

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.250
What the heck is this?

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.140
Hey, Chiko.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:24.650
Chiko.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.410
Chiko's eyes then were just like the boss's.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:38.780
He was training her to be his successor after all.

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.660
Young lady!  Young lady!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:47.160
Young lady!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.500
Where could she have gone?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.580
Young lady!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.420
Oh, thank God.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.680
She's over here!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.740
You found her?

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:04.810
Where?

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:08.580
Over here!  Please, hurry over here!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.610
You'll never...

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.230
...win his heart.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.400
Mister.
